+# Tool Input Validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+The registry validates tool calls against their declared JSON Schema before invoking the tool executor.
+
+1. Required properties, types and enum values are enforced; rejected calls return a descriptive result without exposing input values in results or logs, while valid input including extra properties passes unchanged and unknown tool names still throw. ([validated by: rejects invalid input without exposing values and passes valid input unchanged](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L16))
+2. An uncompilable static schema fails at registration with the tool name. ([validated by: rejects an uncompilable static schema at registration with the tool name](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L54))
+3. Function-valued definitions are validated against the schema resolved for each call. ([validated by: validates each dynamic definition against its current schema](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L63))
